---
<figure class="integrability-art">
  <div class="figure-heading"><span>THE GEOMETRY OF INTEGRABILITY</span><span>01 / YANG–BAXTER</span></div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 560 320" role="img" aria-labelledby="yb-title yb-desc">
    <title id="yb-title">Yang–Baxter relation</title>
    <desc id="yb-desc">Two arrangements of three crossing strands illustrate the Yang–Baxter relation.</desc>
    <defs>
      <pattern id="diagram-grid" width="24" height="24" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r="1" fill="currentColor" opacity=".13" /></pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="560" height="320" fill="url(#diagram-grid)" />
    <g fill="none" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round">
      <path d="M45 265 C45 145 210 175 210 55" stroke="#245e53" />
      <path d="M125 265 C125 205 90 125 125 55" stroke="#b4774d" />
      <path d="M210 265 C210 135 45 175 45 55" stroke="#718b83" />
      <path d="M345 265 C345 135 510 175 510 55" stroke="#245e53" />
      <path d="M425 265 C425 205 460 125 425 55" stroke="#b4774d" />
      <path d="M510 265 C510 145 345 175 345 55" stroke="#718b83" />
    </g>
    <g fill="#245e53" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-style="italic" font-size="18">
      <text x="40" y="38">u</text><text x="120" y="38">v</text><text x="205" y="38">w</text>
      <text x="340" y="38">u</text><text x="420" y="38">v</text><text x="505" y="38">w</text>
      <text x="268" y="169" font-size="28">=</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption><span class="equation">R₁₂ R₁₃ R₂₃ = R₂₃ R₁₃ R₁₂</span><span>Different paths. The same structure.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .integrability-art { margin: 0; color: #245e53; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #cdd8cc; background: #eaf0e6; position: relative; }
  .figure-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; font: 9px/1.5 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .09em; }
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; margin-block: 20px 8px; }
  figcaption { display: grid; gap: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: #526c61; }
  .equation { font: 20px/1.5 Georgia, serif; color: #245e53; }
  @media(max-width: 600px) {
    .integrability-art { padding: var(--space-2); }
    .figure-heading { font-size: 8px; }
    svg { height: 112px; margin-block: var(--space-1); }
    figcaption { gap: 4px; font-size: 10px; }
    .equation { font-size: 18px; }
  }
</style>
